{% if meeting.quorum_threshold %}
\vspace{0.15in}
\subsection*{Quorum Requirement}

A quorum for the transaction of business requires the presence, in person or by proxy, of unit owners entitled to cast
\textbf{ {{ meeting.quorum_threshold }}{\%} } of the total votes of the association.
{% if meeting.adjournment_rules %}
If a quorum is not present, the meeting will be adjourned as follows: {{ meeting.adjournment_rules | tex_escape }}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

{% if meeting.proxy_permitted %}
\vspace{0.15in}
\subsection*{Proxy Voting}

Unit owners who are unable to attend in person may vote by proxy. A proxy form is enclosed with this notice.
Proxies must be signed by the unit owner(s) of record.
{% if meeting.proxy_deadline %}Completed proxies must be received no later than \textbf{ {{ meeting.proxy_deadline | format_date }} }.{% endif %}
Please direct completed proxies to:
{% if management_contact %}{{ management_contact | tex_escape }}{% else %}\fillline{% endif %}.
{% endif %}

